sequenceDiagram
    actor Coordinator
    participant API as Case API
    participant AI as AI Decision Service
    participant Remote as External AI (optional)
    participant DB as SQL Server
    Coordinator->>API: POST /requests/{id}/assess
    API->>AI: Evaluate request
    opt AI provider configured
      AI->>Remote: De-identified request features
      alt Provider responds
        Remote-->>AI: Category, priority, confidence
      else Provider fails/timeout
        AI->>AI: Heuristic fallback
      end
    end
    AI-->>API: Recommendation + rationale
    API->>DB: Save pending review + audit
    Coordinator->>API: POST /requests/{id}/review
    API->>DB: Save decision, actor, reason, time
    API-->>Coordinator: Approved / Modified / Rejected / Deferred
